// Survival production scenario for Worldwake.
//
// Purpose: prove that a survivor can keep the 1440-tick health envelope intact
// when the only lawful food path is facility-backed craft rather than direct
// harvest.
//
// The live runtime's canonical non-harvest production recipe is `Bake Bread`
// at a mill. This scenario therefore isolates that production seam: no apples,
// no grain field, no trade, and no social fallback. Food must come from
// crafting Bread out of stocked Firewood at the camp mill.
(
    seed: 608008,
    survival_health_contract: (
        max_authored_critical_run_ticks: 400,
        max_idle_window_ticks_with_elevated_need: 35,
        elevated_need_floor: 300,
        required_self_care_families: [Eat, Drink, Sleep, Relieve, Wash],
    ),
    places: [
        (name: "Bakery Yard", tags: [Village, Store, Latrine]),
    ],
